# BuildKit picks this up for builds with -f apps/api/Dockerfile, replacing the
# root .dockerignore (which is tuned for the web image). Allowlist style:
# exclude everything, re-include what the API image copies.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!dev-sample-data.md
!apps/api
!apps/web/package.json
!packages/shared
!packages/db
!packages/core
**/node_modules
**/.env*
